    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Need some details of the difference between 'からには' and 'から'",
      "html": "Need some details of the difference between 'からには' and 'から'",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "6402348eb256cae650d2d4df9710f8951c2debc69acd0a1c702687128e928f32",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "からには has the connotation of \"since\" or \"so long as\" or \"Now that\" which cannot be dispensed with simply as \"because.\" 女性に生まれたからには has the connotation of \"So long as I was born a woman\" instead of \"because.\" Also 女性に生まれたからには is an awkward expression. Say 女として生まれたからには.",
      "html": "からには has the connotation of \"since\" or \"so long as\" or \"Now that\" which cannot be dispensed with simply as \"because.\" 女性に生まれたからには has the connotation of \"So long as I was born a woman\" instead of \"because.\" Also 女性に生まれたからには is an awkward expression. Say 女として生まれたからには.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "0a4a33afe46f78c179ee275fdb038a8935047acd0099c3f344bfdba5ea3085df",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "強調 - emphasis only...",
      "html": "強調 - emphasis only...",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "5ee445d999903a2587349cdf0d5dc65f22fd89e8b27a5d99b83bc1659f92786c",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "〜だからこそ",
      "html": "〜だからこそ",
