    {
      "position": 8,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "More accurately, \"Since I was born as a woman, I want to be pretty\" should be \"So long as I was born a woman, I want to stay pretty\".",
      "html": "More accurately, \"Since I was born as a woman, I want to be pretty\" should be \"So long as I was born a woman, I want to stay pretty\".",
